{"id":"19-1927-9-17","zh":"sace saṃkhārā niccā bhavuṃ、bhaveyyuṃ，na nirujjheyyuṃ（如果诸行是常住的，就不会灭去）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-1927-18-22","zh":"yadi tvaṃ bhave、bhaveyyāsi（如果你会成为……）。","confidence":70}
