{"id":"19-1929-20-23","zh":"bhavetho，bhaveyyāvho。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-1929-24-28","zh":"bhave、bhaveyyaṃ，bhaveyyāmhe。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-1929-29-37","zh":"被动语态：sukhaṃ tayā anubhuyye、anubhuyyeyya（安乐可由你感受），anubhuyyuṃ、anubhūyeyyuṃ。","confidence":70}
{"id":"19-1929-38-46","zh":"tena tvaṃ anubhūye、anubhūyeyyāsi，tumhe anubhūyeyyātho、anubhūyeyyātha。","confidence":80}
